                                        </div>
                                        <div role="cell" class="benchmark-cell score-cell athena-score">
                                            <span class="status-badge planned" title="Planned future level. Protocol not yet defined.">Planned</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                ))}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>

        <details class="home-notes">
            <summary>Scoring, coverage, and result statuses</summary>
            <div class="home-notes-body">
                <aside class="disclaimer">
                    <strong>Fixed six-level normalization (29 July 2026).</strong> Full ladder denominator: 63 in every arena. Operational weight is Visual 31/63, Data Retrieval 15/63, and Chess 31/63. Planned and Locked capacity is reserved, so activation never expands the denominator. Current attainable maxima are 49.21%, 23.81%, and 49.21% respectively.
                </aside>
                <aside class="disclaimer benchmark-status-legend" aria-labelledby="benchmark-status-title">
                    <h2 id="benchmark-status-title">Benchmark status legend</h2>
                    <p><strong>Active:</strong> operational and scored. <strong>Planned:</strong> protocol not yet defined; its reserved weight earns zero without a model result. <strong>Locked:</strong> protocol exists but is not operational; its reserved weight earns zero without a model result. <strong>Invalid:</strong> attempted evaluation failed its validity rule; aggregated as zero with weight retained. <strong>Unavailable:</strong> active evaluation could not run; earns zero while denominator 63 remains fixed. <strong>Not tested:</strong> not attempted; earns zero while denominator 63 remains fixed and coverage is incomplete. A numeric 0% is a valid result and retains its weight.</p>
                    <p><strong>Claude 5 Fable (high):</strong> recorded active-level results are included in all three arenas; no unavailable or not-tested value affects its current qualification.</p>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </details>
    </main>
</Layout>

